  "notes": "Three datasheet pages, each a pinout for a different firmware overlay (00002, 00003, 00013) of the same board; transcribed per image. Numbered pins have no GPIO/functional name (only mode tags such as GPIO O, UART I, PWM), so the board pin number is the label; mode tags read outward from the pin. Silkscreen '+3.3' and '+5' listed first in functions for 3V3/5V. Overlay 00013 bracket 'Hardware Bus' spans pins 16-23."
